<view class="page market-page"><view class="row between"><view class="brand-lockup"><image class="brand-mark" src="/assets/logo-mark-96.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="brand-copy"><text class="brand">华立转角</text><text class="campus-text">广州校区 · 计算机学院试点</text></view></view></view><form bindsubmit="search" class="row search"><input name="q" placeholder="搜索教材、球拍、耳机、宿舍好物…"/><button size="mini" form-type="submit">搜索</button></form><view class="native-notice">模拟交易试用 · 不扣真实款项</view><view class="native-channels"><button data-id="" bindtap="category"><view class="channel-icon yellow">↗</view><text>推荐</text></button><button data-id="books" bindtap="category"><view class="channel-icon orange">书</view><text>二手书</text></button><button data-id="living" bindtap="category"><view class="channel-icon green">家</view><text>宿舍生活</text></button><button data-id="sports" bindtap="category"><view class="channel-icon purple">动</view><text>运动好物</text></button><button data-id="electronics" bindtap="category"><view class="channel-icon steel">电</view><text>电子产品</text></button></view><view class="native-promos"><view class="native-promo warm" data-id="books" bindtap="category"><view class="promo-caption">旧书，也有新故事</view><view class="promo-heading">教材不必买新的</view><view class="promo-caption">按版次找书 · 当面看书况</view></view><view class="native-promo cool" data-id="electronics" bindtap="category"><view class="promo-caption">数码，也有第二次相遇</view><view class="promo-heading">好设备继续发光</view><view class="promo-caption">耳机键盘充电宝 · 当面验机</view></view></view><view class="row between native-feed-heading"><text>猜你喜欢</text><text class="muted">广州校区 · 校内交付</text></view><view class="grid"><view class="card" wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail"><image wx:if="{{item.isPhoto}}" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="cover native-photo" style="{{item.coverStyle}}"><text class="photo-label">AI演示图</text></view><text class="cond-badge">{{item.category==='books' ? (item.edition || '版次待确认') : (item.condition || '正常使用')}}</text><view class="card-content"><view class="title"><text class="pickup-label">{{item.delivery==='delivery'?'可送货':'校内自提'}}</text>{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.edition || item.condition}}</view><view class="price">{{item.delivery==='delivery'?'含送货 ¥'+item.delivered:'自提 ¥'+item.priceText}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.delivery==='both'?'送货 ¥'+item.delivered:item.delivery==='delivery'?'送货费用已包含':'仅自提'}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.region}}</view><view class="seller-line"><text class="seller-avatar">{{item.nickname}}</text></view></view></view></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!products.length}}">还没有匹配商品，欢迎发布第一件好物。</view></view><view class="nav"><button data-tab="community" bindtap="nav">社区</button><button data-tab="cart" bindtap="nav">清单</button><button class="primary" data-tab="publish" bindtap="nav">＋发布</button><button data-tab="messages" bindtap="nav">消息</button><button data-tab="me" bindtap="nav">我的</button></view>
